WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.271
Today we will coordinate movement with music. Our work connects with other Ghanaian

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:05.661
communities.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:09.328
Choose two safe steps that suit the chosen rhythm.

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:13.264
Connect them with a pause and a change of direction.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:19.058
Perform the phrase twice with control and enough personal space. Compare your result

00:00:19.058 --> 00:00:21.147
with a second example from Ghana.
